# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in a real value to run the app.
#
# Google Maps API key, exposed to the browser (Next.js requires the
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix for client-side env vars). In Google Cloud Console,
# enable these APIs for the key's project, then restrict the key to your
# domain(s):
#   - Maps JavaScript API   (renders the interactive satellite map)
#   - Places API            (the address search / autocomplete bar)
#   - Geometry library      (bundled with Maps JavaScript API - computes the
#                            traced polygon's square footage; no separate
#                            API to enable, just usable once Maps JS is on)
#   - Drawing library       (bundled with Maps JavaScript API - lets the
#                            estimator draw the lot polygon; no separate
#                            API to enable)
#   - Static Maps API       (renders the polygon snapshot embedded in the
#                            PDF quote)
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
